」","seVolume":1,"duration":3.310430839002268,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_003_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":2.7104308390022678,"id":"A8989AEC-588D-4AEC-B287-9463983E0DCB","slideTitle":"スライド #3"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","title":"シーン 4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.004.jpeg","telop":"「ええ、朝からあなたのことは、噂立ってますから…」\n制作ソフト及び協力\nGemini\nTohoStuido","seVolume":1,"duration":3.5,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_004_古明地さとり.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":2.7203854875283446,"id":"59AAC240-B329-4C6F-97DC-1E75B18AFF70","slideTitle":"スライド #4"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.005.jpeg","telop":"「何で、僕の噂が出たら、困るんですか？」","seVolume":1,"duration":3.7778231292517006,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_005_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":3.1778231292517005,"id":"2B77E280-63BB-4BBF-9B7B-FDF0AC4DEAEB","slideTitle":"スライド #5"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","title":"シーン 6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.006.jpeg","telop":"「それは…、今日の７限目に遠足の班を決めるからですよ…」","seVolume":1,"duration":3.5877777777777777,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_006_古明地さとり.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":2.9877777777777776,"id":"BE6C6D4B-1262-4BFC-BC5C-F0DBAE77AA65","slideTitle":"スライド #6"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.007.jpeg","telop":"「遠足…」僕は、そうつぶやく。そして、今まで、幼少期を除けば、遠足などの校外活動は一切してこなかったことを思い出す。","seVolume":1,"duration":10.330634920634921,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_007_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":9.730634920634921,"id":"CB4D74C6-60CB-4777-9933-1D12D5A73DA2","slideTitle":"スライド #7"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","title":"シーン 8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.008.jpeg","telop":"「まぁ、とりあえず、もうすぐ朝礼ですから、\n席に座ったほうがいいですよ。」","seVolume":1,"duration":4.516598639455782,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_008_古明地さとり.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":3.916598639455782,"id":"B8C4C796-2EF7-48A4-88FD-5367EEC5FA58","slideTitle":"スライド #8"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.009.jpeg","telop":"「そうですね…」僕は、彼女に言われた通り、\n自席に座り、荷物の整理を始めた。","seVolume":1,"duration":6.590861678004535,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_009_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":5.990861678004535,"id":"6679954A-397E-43CD-A495-6D6E390BFB9C","slideTitle":"スライド #9"},{"backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 10: 東方Project二次創作作品　Powerd By zuyasi","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.010.jpeg","seVolume":1,"telop":"元女子校の日常","duration":3,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","id":"3D8F15C9-FD4E-4B85-85A2-186AA35E8DB9","slideTitle":"スライド #10"},{"backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 11: その頃とある場所では…","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.011.jpeg","seVolume":1,"telop":"その頃とある場所では…","duration":3,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","id":"725D90DD-EE85-4C8E-BE07-B6653AAC5FA4","slideTitle":"スライド #11"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","title":"シーン 12","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.012.jpeg","telop":"「ねぇ、フラン。さっきから、どうしたのよ？」\n私は、そう辿々しい動きを見せる妹のフランに問いかける。","seVolume":1,"duration":7.946326530612245,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_012_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.346326530612245,"id":"AC11F24A-F6D5-4A7E-91BC-19261CBB8A93","slideTitle":"スライド #12"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 13","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.013.jpeg","telop":"「えっと…」私は、突如として声をかけられ、そう返す。\nそして、今から10年くらい前のことを思い出す…。","seVolume":1,"duration":9.295736961451247,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_013_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.695736961451248,"id":"8730BC4E-94BF-48A4-B121-717F3EF78969","slideTitle":"スライド #13"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","title":"シーン 14","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.014.jpeg","telop":"「まさか、かつてあなたに告白してきた、ある男児に再び出会って、そのまま彼の血を吸って…」私はある覚悟を決めて聞く。","seVolume":1,"duration":8.609727891156462,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_014_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.009727891156462,"id":"14AE77FA-7A97-499C-BBAF-424A1FE4F1A6","slideTitle":"スライド #14"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 15","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.015.jpeg","telop":"「その通りだよ…お姉様…、私は、久々に見た彼に…」\n私が、その言葉の続きを言いかけると、彼女が苦笑する。","seVolume":1,"duration":10.529478458049887,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_015_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":9.929478458049887,"id":"2E90A551-D235-4AEC-8B92-25F3DF63CFA9","slideTitle":"スライド #15"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","title":"シーン 16","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.016.jpeg","telop":"「私のことは、気にしなくていいのよ、フラン。フランがこの屋敷から、出ていくのだとしも、私は、一人で生きられるから。」","seVolume":1,"duration":8.84424036281179,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_016_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.24424036281179,"id":"6E79763C-B770-4DCC-936F-FEE005ACACA1","slideTitle":"スライド #16"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 17","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.017.jpeg","telop":"「自分の部屋にこもって、少し考えてきてもいい？」\n私は、そう彼女に聞く。","seVolume":1,"duration":7.045736961451246,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_017_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.445736961451247,"id":"51818272-47CD-41C5-B8FF-6DAB2903F334","slideTitle":"スライド #17"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","title":"シーン 18","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.018.jpeg","telop":"「いいわよ、あなたの将来に関わる、\n大事なことなんだから、ちゃんと考えてきなさい。」","seVolume":1,"duration":6.048412698412698,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_018_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":5.448412698412699,"id":"0C2F179E-A92F-49CB-9401-DD0E5A4359FF","slideTitle":"スライド #18"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","title":"シーン 19","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.019.jpeg","telop":"「私は、姉として、この屋敷の主人として…、失格ね…。」\n私は、フランが部屋を離れると、そう一人小言をつぶやく。","seVolume":1,"duration":8.942154195011337,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_019_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.342154195011338,"id":"987BD95B-E54A-4F90-823C-8E3DC8B210AD","slideTitle":"スライド #19"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","title":"シーン 20","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.020.jpeg","telop":"私は、ふと目から涙がポタポタと垂れていることに気づく。\n「あれ…いつの間に…」私はそう呟くと、一人で笑った。","seVolume":1,"duration":8.53532879818594,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_020_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.935328798185941,"id":"BC5AF09E-2B56-4AD5-9AD0-06293B36E197","slideTitle":"スライド #20"},{"backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 21: 一方でフランは…","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.021.jpeg","seVolume":1,"telop":"一方でフランは…","duration":3,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","id":"7BDE5225-12F5-4F8A-9639-9EF4E1F21E8E","slideTitle":"スライド #21"},{"backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 22","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.022.jpeg","telop":"私は、自分の部屋に戻ると、再び10年前、試験的な取り組みで、ある幼稚園のクラスの担当をしてたときを思い出す。","seVolume":1,"duration":10.281995464852608,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_022_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":9.681995464852609,"id":"8F4C5D50-E1ED-4C22-8EF8-8B33D1B37116","slideTitle":"スライド #22"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 23","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.023.jpeg","telop":"私は、10年前、日々の解体工事にくる文句で溜まった疲労を癒そうとお姉様がいい、ある幼稚園のクラスを任されたときだった。","seVolume":1,"duration":10.525736961451246,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_023_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":9.925736961451246,"id":"F65A5F99-6FA0-4A78-9AF5-8F970F3A6039","slideTitle":"スライド #23"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 24","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.024.jpeg","telop":"その幼稚園は、著名な男子校の幼稚部に属する幼稚園で、その名の通り男児だけのクラスのみで、全体が構成されていた。","seVolume":1,"duration":10.206984126984127,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_024_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":9.606984126984127,"id":"0861E7D5-CB1E-4216-89A7-32CB574A46E2","slideTitle":"スライド #24"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 25","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.025.jpeg","telop":"私たちは、それとは対照的な女子校出身だったので、\nそれと比べて意外とその日々は新鮮味を感じていた。","seVolume":1,"duration":8.994489795918367,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_025_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.394489795918368,"id":"E9227526-978B-4489-8890-DBC993825EA4","slideTitle":"スライド #25"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 26","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.026.jpeg","telop":"事の発端は、ある劇の発表をしていたときだった。","seVolume":1,"duration":4.565736961451247,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_026_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":3.965736961451247,"id":"5632C207-F5B1-410A-BD5B-043F757DE204","slideTitle":"スライド #26"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 27","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.027.jpeg","telop":"それは、事前に収録し、編集した劇の動画を上映する形での発表だった。そして、その発表途中に、部屋を飛び出る男児が出る。","seVolume":1,"duration":11.703242630385487,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_027_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":11.103242630385488,"id":"2994B208-C015-4936-A47B-4E9011927149","slideTitle":"スライド #27"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 28","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.028.jpeg","telop":"私が、その男児の後を追いかけると、遠くには、その男児は言っておらず、周囲をキョロキョロしながら、私に目線を当てる。","seVolume":1,"duration":10.046984126984126,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_028_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":9.446984126984127,"id":"C3B29161-1806-4B67-AF0E-BD1718F32AB3","slideTitle":"スライド #28"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 29","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.029.jpeg","telop":"すると、彼は、私の方を真正面に見つめ、ある言葉を告げる。","seVolume":1,"duration":5.901995464852607,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_029_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":5.301995464852608,"id":"EC824125-5D4B-4C5A-9455-08D7F1673A08","slideTitle":"スライド #29"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 30","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.030.jpeg","telop":"その彼の行動に対して私は、一言返す程度だった。","seVolume":1,"duration":4.980748299319727,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_030_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":4.380748299319728,"id":"48675AE5-F9C1-4F41-9369-09363314EE92","slideTitle":"スライド #30"},{"backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 31","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.031.jpeg","telop":"今考えると、彼は、あえて発表中に部屋を飛び出ると言う、目立つ行動で私を外に出し、同年代の男児から離れたのだと思う。","seVolume":1,"duration":10.894489795918368,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_031_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":10.294489795918368,"id":"6BB5CBFD-A3B2-4DC5-A0DD-A951BBE9EC56","slideTitle":"スライド #31"},{"backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 32","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.032.jpeg","telop":"私が聞いたところでは、その後、彼は、勉学における成績で、常に学内トップだったとか。だが、欠けてるとこもあるとか…。","seVolume":1,"duration":11.039478458049887,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_032_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":10.439478458049887,"id":"7CC2C699-C266-4EF5-A4CF-00CA84A783B8","slideTitle":"スライド #32"},{"backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 33","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.033.jpeg","telop":"私の母校と彼が元いた学校の学力は同等あるいは、私の母校がより高いので、中途入学のための入試難易度もそれなりに高い。","seVolume":1,"duration":11.247732426303855,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_033_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":10.647732426303856,"id":"36A203D4-FD8A-43AC-BB72-0FE2C2FE1AD9","slideTitle":"スライド #33"},{"backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 34","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.034.jpeg","telop":"そして、あのとき…、ふとある情報を入手し、深夜帯に母校を突撃すると、情報にあった通り、彼の姿を発見した。","seVolume":1,"duration":10.119478458049887,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_034_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":9.519478458049887,"id":"8D191057-5454-4CB2-80C6-525D2844B3AC","slideTitle":"スライド #34"},{"backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 35","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.035.jpeg","telop":"あの時の私は、深夜テンションなのか、それとも、久々に彼に会ったからなのか、数人程度しかやっていない吸血をした。","seVolume":1,"duration":10.071995464852607,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_035_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":9.471995464852608,"id":"7AE57A11-C485-499F-B6A8-96631BC8C804","slideTitle":"スライド #35"},{"backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 36","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.036.jpeg","telop":"なぜ、そうしたのか、私にはまだ、完全には把握しきれてないし、この気持ちの正体もいまだに、どっちかわからない。","seVolume":1,"duration":9.759478458049886,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_036_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":9.159478458049886,"id":"26BE7C0B-83C6-4467-BB80-305AB4EEE9B3","slideTitle":"スライド #36"},{"backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 37","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.037.jpeg","telop":"単純に彼の背が伸びたからなのか、それとも…、私があの夜吸血する前に見た彼に、一目惚れしたからなのか…、わからない。","seVolume":1,"duration":10.256984126984127,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_037_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":9.656984126984128,"id":"5C990607-4098-4ACC-98F4-67FD51183FAE","slideTitle":"スライド #37"},{"backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 38","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.038.jpeg","telop":"でも、この気持ちを確かめて、蹴りをつけないと、お姉様の仕事の手伝いで気が抜けてしまいそうだった。「どうしよう…」","seVolume":1,"duration":9.513242630385488,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_038_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.913242630385488,"id":"6F278767-EF53-4AE0-98FC-51AE6C3E83D4","slideTitle":"スライド #38"},{"backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","title":"シーン 39","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.039.jpeg","telop":"私は、それから、しばらく考え込むのだった。","seVolume":1,"duration":4.320748299319728,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_039_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":3.720748299319728,"id":"6E67DDD7-4573-4151-97F3-184B771221D7","slideTitle":"スライド #39"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"ナレーション","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 40","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.040.jpeg","telop":"彼に視点が戻り…","seVolume":1,"duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","id":"9D298693-451E-4D67-B46C-BC176685CE0F","slideTitle":"スライド #40"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 41","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.041.jpeg","telop":"あれから、６限までの授業を無事に乗り切った僕は、\n遠足の班決めが始まる時間になっていた。","seVolume":1,"duration":6.819115646258503,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_041_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.219115646258503,"id":"37C58EB5-ED61-469A-A37C-CF854AF28D93","slideTitle":"スライド #41"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 42","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.042.jpeg","telop":"すると、教室の扉が開き、さとりが早苗師匠と読んでいた女性が入ってくる。そして、僕は、女子たちの挨拶に合わせる。","seVolume":1,"duration":9.3778231292517,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_042_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.7778231292517,"id":"07D7A31E-3B07-49DB-9960-5BA59DF9F824","slideTitle":"スライド #42"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"東風谷早苗","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E6%9D%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%B0%B7%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"東風谷早苗","title":"シーン 43","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.043.jpeg","telop":"「着席してください。」","seVolume":1,"duration":3.5,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_043_東風谷早苗.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":1.5,"id":"BE91A8DC-45DC-46A9-8AFC-5E34F30E6A4E","slideTitle":"スライド #43"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 44","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.044.jpeg","telop":"彼女がそう言うと、女子たちが一斉に着席し、\n僕もそれに合わせる。すると、彼女が話し始める。","seVolume":1,"duration":7.693038548752834,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_044_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.093038548752834,"id":"673DD342-D728-4FCA-BE4C-E615FE88764A","slideTitle":"スライド #44"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"東風谷早苗","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E6%9D%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%B0%B7%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"東風谷早苗","title":"シーン 45","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.045.jpeg","telop":"「これから、放送で遠足に関する注意事項と、規定の放送、そして、あらかじめ決められた特定の生徒の班分け表を配ります。」","seVolume":1,"duration":9.002222222222223,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_045_東風谷早苗.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.402222222222223,"id":"00DEB7DF-8F24-47E4-AE43-8EF995DEFFE3","slideTitle":"スライド #45"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"東風谷早苗","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E6%9D%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%B0%B7%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"東風谷早苗","title":"シーン 46","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.046.jpeg","telop":"「特定の生徒の班分けも放送されるので、よく聞くように。」","seVolume":1,"duration":4.356848072562358,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_046_東風谷早苗.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":3.756848072562358,"id":"01AF2ADC-2B4E-45B4-A749-F9902FCC2E78","slideTitle":"スライド #46"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 47","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.047.jpeg","telop":"彼女がそう言うと、校内放送が流れる。そして、その放送の最後に流れた、事前に決められた班分けに教室が、ざわつく。","seVolume":1,"duration":9.610430839002268,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_047_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":9.010430839002268,"id":"16CBA9C6-A1DF-40BD-A41C-7B84C001E8AB","slideTitle":"スライド #47"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"東風谷早苗","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E6%9D%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%B0%B7%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"東風谷早苗","title":"シーン 48","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.048.jpeg","telop":"「静かに、放送でもあった通り、K-3組の古明地こいし、当クラスの古明地さとり、藤原紅夢、U-4組のアリス・マーガトロイドは同じ班で行動してもらいます。」","seVolume":1,"duration":11.38111111111111,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_048_東風谷早苗.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":10.78111111111111,"id":"6A91097D-B038-43AE-BABC-9111F18A53A3","slideTitle":"スライド #48"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"東風谷早苗","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E6%9D%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%B0%B7%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"東風谷早苗","title":"シーン 49","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.049.jpeg","telop":"「今から、当クラスから該当する藤原さんと古明地さんには、放送で指定された、別室にて、話し合いを進めてもらいます。二人は帰りの支度を持っていくように。」","seVolume":1,"duration":11.162857142857142,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_049_東風谷早苗.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":10.562857142857142,"id":"CD600DF8-1081-4A8F-A9FB-BFDE9BA27364","slideTitle":"スライド #49"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 50","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.050.jpeg","telop":"僕は、困惑しながらも、見知らぬ女子と行動するよりかは、マシかと…、そう決めて、帰りを支度を済ませ、教室を出た。","seVolume":1,"duration":8.899546485260771,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_050_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.299546485260771,"id":"718E79B0-6E4B-4307-9C4B-5AEC44945E64","slideTitle":"スライド #50"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"ナレーション","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 51","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.051.jpeg","telop":"彼が別室に向かうと…","seVolume":1,"duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","id":"E0B30E97-9374-4F62-A3D4-DAED87A55AF4","slideTitle":"スライド #51"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 52","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.052.jpeg","telop":"それから、僕が、指定された部屋にさとりと共に入ると、\nすでに、他のクラスからきた2人は、部屋で待っていた。","seVolume":1,"duration":8.293038548752834,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_052_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.693038548752835,"id":"77487ADE-55E8-42E0-927E-B920AB5B1570","slideTitle":"スライド #52"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 53","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.053.jpeg","telop":"すると、沈黙の時間と、変な空気感が部屋を包み込む。","seVolume":1,"duration":4.7278231292517,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_053_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":4.1278231292517,"id":"73988126-A3B9-4F8E-8AB9-13C1626BEEB8","slideTitle":"スライド #53"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AA%E3%82%B9%E3%83%BB%E3%83%9E%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AC%E3%83%88%E3%83%AD%E3%82%A4%E3%83%89","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","title":"シーン 54","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.054.jpeg","telop":"「とりあえず、遠足のための調べ物をしませんか？」","seVolume":1,"duration":3.5,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_054_アリス・マーガトロイド.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":2.666326530612245,"id":"01A68CAA-1664-4613-8E93-9AFF6F621B00","slideTitle":"スライド #54"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","title":"シーン 55","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.055.jpeg","telop":"「今回の目的地は、副都心か臨海部だそうですよ。」","seVolume":1,"duration":3.580997732426304,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_055_古明地さとり.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":2.980997732426304,"id":"767A6F04-D8A2-46B3-BE2D-E8B64E854FE4","slideTitle":"スライド #55"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%93%E3%81%84%E3%81%97","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","title":"シーン 56","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.056.jpeg","telop":"「藤原さんは、池袋・新宿・渋谷とお台場、どっちに行きたい？」","seVolume":1,"duration":3.5,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_056_古明地こいし.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":2.842244897959184,"id":"236AD449-BAAC-458E-8478-2BAA80608C16","slideTitle":"スライド #56"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 57","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.057.jpeg","telop":"「僕は…、お台場が空いてそうだから、そっちがいいです…」","seVolume":1,"duration":4.371292517006802,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_057_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":3.7712925170068026,"id":"FD865656-23FB-4907-A262-C06DEA015B44","slideTitle":"スライド #57"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AA%E3%82%B9%E3%83%BB%E3%83%9E%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AC%E3%83%88%E3%83%AD%E3%82%A4%E3%83%89","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","title":"シーン 58","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.058.jpeg","telop":"「それで、誰かお台場に行ったことがある人は…」","seVolume":1,"duration":3.5,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_058_アリス・マーガトロイド.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":2.415374149659864,"id":"9301A404-7D6C-49D9-828F-29421A81BDE6","slideTitle":"スライド #58"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 59","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.059.jpeg","telop":"「僕は…昔に家族で何度か行きました…」","seVolume":1,"duration":3.5930385487528347,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_059_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":2.9930385487528346,"id":"742CB4CA-2A08-40A6-81B4-14DEAD6D81A9","slideTitle":"スライド #59"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%93%E3%81%84%E3%81%97","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","title":"シーン 60","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.060.jpeg","telop":"「私は、名前は知っているけど行ったことはないよ…」","seVolume":1,"duration":3.5,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_060_古明地こいし.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":2.23312925170068,"id":"2654BE09-B074-4C28-813A-D0FF04E24583","slideTitle":"スライド #60"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","title":"シーン 61","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.061.jpeg","telop":"「私も、こいしと一緒ですよ…」","seVolume":1,"duration":3.5,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_061_古明地さとり.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":1.7693877551020407,"id":"DDF17733-FBD3-4376-B501-9F2D5D56AEE4","slideTitle":"スライド #61"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AA%E3%82%B9%E3%83%BB%E3%83%9E%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AC%E3%83%88%E3%83%AD%E3%82%A4%E3%83%89","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","title":"シーン 62","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.062.jpeg","telop":"「私は…国際展示場での発表で何度かだけ…です。」","seVolume":1,"duration":3.9113378684807256,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_062_アリス・マーガトロイド.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":3.3113378684807255,"id":"88971A8B-284D-455C-A249-0D429F8864F2","slideTitle":"スライド #62"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 63","seStartTimeOffset":2.49,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.063.jpeg","telop":"「そうですか…」僕がそう言っていると、扉が開く。","seVolume":0.85,"seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/教室の戸を開ける.mp3","duration":4.099546485260771,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_063_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","seName":"[SE] 教室の戸を開ける.mp3","voiceDuration":3.499546485260771,"id":"72C123B2-C8F9-43A7-A37F-CA57BA49920F","slideTitle":"スライド #63"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","title":"シーン 64","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.064.jpeg","telop":"「おや、みなさん、お揃いのようで…」\n私はそう言いながら、ある紙を出し、机に置く。","seVolume":1,"duration":5.668095238095238,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_064_十六夜咲夜.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","voiceDuration":5.068095238095238,"id":"3AA4A724-9C9A-4C62-9FD6-7EFE2E2462E3","slideTitle":"スライド #64"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","title":"シーン 65","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.065.jpeg","telop":"「これは、遠足ノートです。あなたたちの班は、遠足にかかる費用が、全額学校負担になってますので、確認してください。」","seVolume":1,"duration":8.383083900226758,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_065_十六夜咲夜.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","voiceDuration":7.783083900226758,"id":"CFBFEE3B-0EF8-4C41-8F67-C051A3767F15","slideTitle":"スライド #65"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 66","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.066.jpeg","telop":"突如やってきて、ノートを残し、彼女が去ると、こいしたちが驚いた表情を見せる。僕も、内心驚いていた…。","seVolume":1,"duration":8.588684807256236,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_066_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（驚く）.png","voiceDuration":7.988684807256236,"id":"181E227B-C9A9-4AFA-BEBA-444649579A1A","slideTitle":"スライド #66"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","title":"シーン 67","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.067.jpeg","telop":"「一体これは、なぜこんな待遇なのでしょう…、普通だったら、必要な費用は自前調達ですが…、学校が全額負担とは…」","seVolume":1,"duration":7.0987981859410425,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_067_古明地さとり.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.498798185941043,"id":"183F75AA-FC39-409A-995E-50924A17BFA3","slideTitle":"スライド #67"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 68","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.068.jpeg","telop":"「さぁ、わからないです…。」僕はそう言うと、ふとそのノートを取って中身を見る。そこには、ある内容が書かれていた。","seVolume":1,"duration":8.501723356009071,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_068_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.901723356009071,"id":"D0F86AC6-A63E-4ED0-B24A-D9063342E311","slideTitle":"スライド #68"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 69","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.069.jpeg","telop":"「全国財閥校統一模試…」そのノートには、僕がこの試験を遠足の2週間前に受けて、その結果が遠足に関わると書いてあった。","seVolume":1,"duration":9.744126984126984,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_069_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":9.144126984126984,"id":"120B0A03-50C4-46E3-976C-274C6877AA3D","slideTitle":"スライド #69"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AA%E3%82%B9%E3%83%BB%E3%83%9E%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AC%E3%83%88%E3%83%AD%E3%82%A4%E3%83%89","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","title":"シーン 70","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.070.jpeg","telop":"「これ…、私たちのような偏差値や学力に加えて、\nそれなりに敷居が高い学校で生き残るための模擬試験ですよ…」","seVolume":1,"duration":6.628639455782313,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_070_アリス・マーガトロイド.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.028639455782313,"id":"6055402C-8225-45A1-B740-97E82CFDF8FD","slideTitle":"スライド #70"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 71","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.071.jpeg","telop":"「確か、一般的な高校入試とは、別枠の財力を持つ家の子どもが受けるやつですよね…、僕は、受けてませんが…」","seVolume":1,"duration":8.545215419501133,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_071_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.9452154195011335,"id":"DA0C562B-7245-4B58-A7C9-E1CA4327C1B3","slideTitle":"スライド #71"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 72","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.072.jpeg","telop":"そして、遠足以外にも、僕が受けたこの試験の結果は、彼女たちの今後も左右する可能性があると…記載されていた…。","seVolume":1,"duration":8.7278231292517,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_072_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.1278231292517,"id":"B0618CEE-E6FF-4ED0-B8EC-5AEB5E2AFA19","slideTitle":"スライド #72"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 73","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.073.jpeg","telop":"「これは…実質的に、こいしさんたちの学業が、僕の試験の結果の内容によって左右する…、どんな目的でこんなことを…」","seVolume":1,"duration":9.023469387755101,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_073_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.423469387755102,"id":"4C237ACD-F8C7-41A8-9A0B-4775B04B4C55","slideTitle":"スライド #73"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AA%E3%82%B9%E3%83%BB%E3%83%9E%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AC%E3%83%88%E3%83%AD%E3%82%A4%E3%83%89","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","title":"シーン 74","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.074.jpeg","telop":"「さぁ、私には分かりませんが、少なくとも、私たちの学校生活に関わるということは…確定しているみたいです…」","seVolume":1,"duration":7.0359410430839,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_074_アリス・マーガトロイド.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.435941043083901,"id":"682F7E0E-7342-485D-B864-FAC352EF31E0","slideTitle":"スライド #74"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 75","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.075.jpeg","telop":"僕はそこから、ノートを読み進めると、遠足の流れや、予定に加え、彼女たちの学業にも関わる試験だと詳細に書かれていた。","seVolume":1,"duration":9.488684807256236,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_075_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.888684807256237,"id":"1955053D-BF6F-4ACE-BB3D-6DE9FA64C736","slideTitle":"スライド #75"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 76","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.076.jpeg","telop":"そして、最後にこう書いてあった。模擬試験は筆記による通常の試験を2週間後、そしてその他の試験を遠足後に行うと…。","seVolume":1,"duration":8.97891156462585,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_076_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.37891156462585,"id":"F452D140-43F4-466F-B70C-82D86BAB5ACD","slideTitle":"スライド #76"},{"backgroundName":"nc378787_文化系の部室（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 77","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.077.jpeg","telop":"僕は、これまでたくさんの時間を勉学に使い、励んできたきたが、ここでは、それを違った形で要求されるようだった。","seVolume":1,"duration":8.70063492063492,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_077_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.10063492063492,"id":"53086161-FB53-4844-9A73-434C949E7E3F","slideTitle":"スライド #77"},{"backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seStartTimeOffset":0.3,"title":"シーン 78: ご視聴ありがとうございました！","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee\/元女子校の日常　第7話_5126a3ddee.078.jpeg","telop":"ご視聴ありがとうございました！","seVolume":0.243017578125,"seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/動画用\/音楽\/BGM\/nc122879_【東方アレンジ】砕月～いぶきすいかのものがたり～.wav","duration":20,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","seName":"SE: nc122879_【東方アレンジ】砕月～いぶきすいかのものがたり～","id":"592C6498-76AA-4742-A281-7806435E99F1","slideTitle":"スライド #78"}]